Users may request deletion of personal information associated with RabuShinAIGM.

Depending on the information and campaign structure, deletion may include:

removing an account association;
removing campaign membership;
deleting owned character information;
deleting stored profile information; or
deleting other personally associated information.

Some campaign information may need to be retained or anonymized where removing it would damage shared campaign history or where retention is legally required.

