10. Security

We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards intended to protect information handled through RabuShinAIGM.

These may include:

authenticated access;
authorization controls;
database access policies;
encrypted network connections;
restricted application credentials;
user-specific access controls; and
secure credential handling.

No online system can guarantee absolute security.

Users should never post passwords, private API keys, or other credentials in campaign chat.

11. International Processing

Third-party providers used by RabuShinAIGM may process data from locations outside your state, province, or country.

By using the Service, information may therefore be processed in jurisdictions with privacy laws different from those where you live.

Where required, appropriate mechanisms will be used for international data processing.

12. Children's Privacy

RabuShinAIGM is designed for users who are legally eligible to use Discord.

We do not knowingly use RabuShinAIGM to solicit personal information from children who are below the age permitted to use Discord in their jurisdiction.

If you believe information from an ineligible minor has been collected, contact us so that it can be reviewed and, where appropriate, deleted.

